<title>USA: GTSI, Air Force settle contract dispute.</title>
<headline>GTSI, Air Force settle contract dispute.</headline>
<dateline>CHANTILLY, Va. 1997-02-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Government Technology Services Inc said on Friday it settled a contract dispute with the U.S Air Force, with GTSI withdrawing its appeals claim and the Air Force agreeing to a specific number of software upgrades which GTSI must supply.</p>
<p>GTSI said an additional reserve of up to $900,000 will be required for 1996. Results for the year will be reported on or about February 14.</p>
<p>GTSI said it withdrew &quot;with prejudice&quot; its claim at the Armed Services Contract Board of Appeals.</p>
<p>	  ((-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610))</p>
